---
import CommunityLayout from "../../layouts/CommunityLayout.astro";

const directionRows = [
  {
    item: "Home / App Library 分层",
    status: "已明确",
    note: "主界面负责快速进入，应用库负责整理功能入口，不按手机桌面方式堆叠图标。",
  },
  {
    item: "Navi 作为交互入口",
    status: "方向已写明",
    note: "Navi 被定义为更轻的任务入口，重点是少步骤完成当前任务，而不是先找 App 再操作。",
  },
  {
    item: "语音 / 按键确认边界",
    status: "边界已说明",
    note: "语音唤醒、按键或触控都属于显式触发或确认层，不应写成默认自动执行。",
  },
  {
    item: "按需调用感知能力",
    status: "原则已明确",
    note: "摄像头和麦克风应在任务需要时调用，而不是默认持续开启。",
  },
  {
    item: "硬件 provider 能力",
    status: "未证明",
    note: "真实眼动、厂商 SDK、OpenXR 或相机级集成没有已证明实现，不应反向推导为支持。",
  },
];

const nextSteps = [
  "真实设备验证",
  "交互边界验证",
  "语音 / 按键 / 手机端协同测试",
  "论坛收集用户反馈",
] as const;
---

<CommunityLayout
  title="Gaze Launcher"
  description="面向 AR / AI 眼镜的 AI-first 智能启动器。"
  canonical="https://openglasshub.pages.dev/gaze-launcher/"
  activeSection="launcher"
>
  <section class="launcher-page">
    <main class="launcher-main">
      <section class="launcher-hero">
        <div class="launcher-status">开发中 / 实验性</div>
        <h1>Gaze Launcher</h1>
        <p class="launcher-subtitle">面向 AR / AI 眼镜的 AI-first 智能启动器</p>
        <p class="community-page-lead launcher-lead">当前仍是实验性项目，聚焦产品方向和下一步验证重点。</p>
        <div class="community-cta-row">
          <a href="#progress" class="community-button">查看当前进展</a>
          <a href="/feed/" class="community-button--secondary">进入论坛讨论</a>
          <a href="#boundaries" class="community-button--secondary">查看边界说明</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="launcher-block" id="details">
        <div class="launcher-block__head">
          <h2>为什么需要 Gaze Launcher</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="launcher-copy">
          <p>智能眼镜不应该照搬手机桌面逻辑。手机上的常见路径是先找应用、再进入功能、最后手动完成任务，但眼镜更适合快速、轻量、少打扰的任务流。</p>
          <p>Gaze Launcher 想连接的是 Home、App Library、Navi、以及手机端管理，让用户先面对当前任务，再决定要不要调用语音、按键、触控或手机端协同，而不是先被应用列表打断。</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="launcher-block">
        <div class="launcher-block__head">
          <h2>核心结构</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="community-list launcher-structure">
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>Home</strong>
            <p>主界面优先展示常用入口、最近任务和当前状态，不把第一屏做成图标墙。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>App Library</strong>
            <p>把翻译、导航、笔记、设置等入口整理成更适合眼镜理解和查找的结构。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>Navi AI Assistant</strong>
            <p>作为任务入口被调用，重点是“看见内容后下一步做什么”，而不是先寻找独立应用。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>手机端管理</strong>
            <p>账号、设置、历史记录、复杂输入和远程控制更适合放在手机端完成，眼镜端保持轻量。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>确认层</strong>
            <p>语音、按键、触控和可能的其它输入方式都应建立在显式触发和确认之上，而不是自动执行。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="launcher-block" id="progress">
        <div class="launcher-block__head">
          <h2>当前已明确的方向</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="community-table">
          {directionRows.map((row) => (
            <article class="community-table-row">
              <strong>{row.item}</strong>
              <span>{row.status}</span>
              <p>{row.note}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="launcher-block" id="boundaries">
        <div class="launcher-block__head">
          <h2>当前边界</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="community-list launcher-boundaries">
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>项目阶段</strong>
            <p>当前仍在开发和验证中，重点是梳理更适合眼镜的启动方式与交互路径。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>输入能力</strong>
            <p>当前重点仍是语音、按键、触控等显式输入路径，相关交互边界需要继续验证。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>平台集成</strong>
            <p>厂商 SDK、运行时能力和硬件级集成仍需要结合具体设备继续确认。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="community-list-item">
            <strong>设备适配</strong>
            <p>真实设备兼容性和安装路径，需要在后续验证中逐步收敛。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="launcher-block">
        <div class="launcher-block__head">
          <h2>下一步</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="community-list">
          {nextSteps.map((item) => (
            <article class="community-list-item">
              <strong>{item}</strong>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <aside class="launcher-side">
      <section class="community-surface community-surface--padded community-surface--primary">
        <div class="community-meta" style="margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">当前状态</div>
        <h2>实验性项目</h2>
        <p>这里集中整理产品方向、结构拆分和验证重点。</p>
        <div class="community-list" style="padding: 0.7rem 0 0;">
          <a class="community-list-item community-link-row" href="#details">
            <strong>查看完整说明</strong>
            <span>为什么需要它，以及它如何组织 Home、App Library、Navi 和手机端协同。</span>
          </a>
          <a class="community-list-item community-link-row" href="#boundaries">
            <strong>查看当前边界</strong>
            <span>哪些能力还没有正式承诺，避免把方向误读成现成功能。</span>
          </a>
          <a class="community-list-item community-link-row" href="/feed/">
            <strong>进入论坛讨论</strong>
            <span>围绕真实设备、输入边界和运行时问题继续讨论。</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </section>
</CommunityLayout>

<style>
  .launcher-page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .launcher-main {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }
  .launcher-hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .launcher-status {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .launcher-hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 2.9rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  .launcher-subtitle {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .launcher-lead {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .launcher-block {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .launcher-block__head {
    padding-bottom: 0.7rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .launcher-block__head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .launcher-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .launcher-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .launcher-structure,
  .launcher-boundaries {
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
  }
  .launcher-side {
    position: sticky;
    top: 92px;
  }
  .launcher-side h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .launcher-side p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .launcher-page {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .launcher-side {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
